@*  QC-004 NCR Register user manual. *@

<div class="help-doc">
    <div>
        <div class="help-h1">QC-004 · NCR REGISTER</div>
        <div class="help-sub">부적합 보고서 — 심각도 + 처분 + Open 리스트</div>

        <svg class="help-svg" viewBox="0 0 720 480" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
            <rect x="6" y="6" width="708" height="468" rx="10" fill="#000" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,.18)" stroke-width="1.5" />
            <rect class="hs-region tbar" x="14" y="14" width="692" height="42" fill="#1a0000" stroke="rgba(220,38,38,.35)" />

            @for (var i = 0; i < 4; i++)
            {
                var x = 14 + i * 174; var cls = new[]{"bad","warn","","ok"}[i];
                var titles = new[]{"CRITICAL","MAJOR","MINOR","CLOSED 7D"};
                var vals = new[]{"1","1","1","0"};
                <g>
                    <rect class="hs-region @cls" x="@x" y="68" width="162" height="74" />
                    <text class="hs-sub" x="@(x+12)" y="88" fill="#fca5a5">@titles[i]</text>
                    <text class="hs-label" x="@(x+12)" y="124" style="font-size:22px;">@vals[i]</text>
                </g>
            }
            <circle class="hs-num" cx="24" cy="78" r="14" />
            <text class="hs-num-tx" x="24" y="78">1</text>

            <rect class="hs-region" x="14" y="156" width="692" height="200" />
            <text class="hs-sub" x="28" y="176" fill="#fca5a5">▼ OPEN NCRs · 3</text>
            @{
                var sevs = new[] {"critical","major","minor"};
                var labels = new[] {"CRITICAL","MAJOR","MINOR"};
            }
            @for (var i = 0; i < 3; i++)
            {
                var x = 28 + i * 226;
                <g>
                    <rect class="hs-region @sevs[i]" x="@x" y="192" width="220" height="156" />
                    <text class="hs-sub" x="@(x+12)" y="212">NCR-25060@(i+1)</text>
                    <text class="hs-label" x="@(x+12)" y="244" style="font-size:14px;">@labels[i]</text>
                    <text class="hs-sub" x="@(x+12)" y="276">DOOR TRIM @(i==2 ? "LH" : "RH")</text>
                    <text class="hs-sub" x="@(x+12)" y="300">QTY @(new[]{"32","96","6"}[i])</text>
                    <text class="hs-sub" x="@(x+12)" y="324">DISP @(new[]{"RTV","HOLD","REWORK"}[i])</text>
                </g>
            }
            <circle class="hs-num" cx="24" cy="166" r="14" />
            <text class="hs-num-tx" x="24" y="166">2</text>

            <rect class="hs-region" x="14" y="370" width="492" height="50" />
            <text class="hs-sub" x="28" y="402">SEV · SRC · ITEM · QTY · DISP</text>
            <circle class="hs-num" cx="24" cy="380" r="14" />
            <text class="hs-num-tx" x="24" y="380">3</text>
            <rect class="hs-region ok" x="520" y="370" width="186" height="50" />
            <text class="hs-label" x="612" y="402" text-anchor="middle" style="font-size:16px;">⚠ REPORT NCR</text>
            <circle class="hs-num" cx="530" cy="380" r="13" />
            <text class="hs-num-tx" x="530" y="380">4</text>

            <rect class="hs-region nav" x="14" y="432" width="692" height="32" />
        </svg>
    </div>

    <div>
        <div class="help-section-h">▶ STEPS · 단계</div>
        <div class="help-steps">
            <div class="help-step bad"><div class="help-step-num">1</div><div class="help-step-body"><div class="help-step-en">Severity counts. Critical = customer escalation.</div><div class="help-step-ko">심각도별 카운트. Critical = 고객 에스컬레이션.</div></div></div>
            <div class="help-step"><div class="help-step-num">2</div><div class="help-step-body"><div class="help-step-en">Open NCR cards. Left border colour matches severity (red/orange/yellow).</div><div class="help-step-ko">Open NCR 카드. 좌측 테두리 = 심각도 색.</div></div></div>
            <div class="help-step"><div class="help-step-num">3</div><div class="help-step-body"><div class="help-step-en">Quick entry form — severity / source / item / qty / disposition.</div><div class="help-step-ko">간편 등록 폼.</div></div></div>
            <div class="help-step ok"><div class="help-step-num">4</div><div class="help-step-body"><div class="help-step-en">REPORT writes QC_NCR with Status=Open.</div><div class="help-step-ko">등록 시 QC_NCR Open 상태로 기록.</div></div></div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
